# Blockchain ↔ MERN Integration — Walkthrough

## Summary

Integrated the `SecureVoting.sol` smart contract into the existing Vota MERN-stack voting application. All changes are **additive** — no existing UI/CSS, database schemas, or Express routes were altered or deleted.

---

## What Changed

### 🔧 Bug Fixes

| File | Bug | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| [Voting.json](file:///c:/Users/PIYUSH/Blockchain-based-voting-system/Frontend/src/contracts/Voting.json) | ABI referenced `castVote()` — contract function is `vote()` | Replaced with correct compiled ABI |
| [server.js](file:///c:/Users/PIYUSH/Blockchain-based-voting-system/backend/server.js) | `votingRoutes` imported but **never mounted** | Now mounted at `/votes` |
