## Remaining Manual Steps

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Run the database migration** before testing wallet linking:
> ```sql
> mysql -u root -p voting_system < backend/src/models/wallet.migration.sql
> ```

> [!NOTE]
> **Contract redeployment**: If you need a fresh contract (e.g., new candidates), run:
> ```bash
> cd backend && node deploy.js
> ```
> Then update the contract address in `Frontend/.env` and `backend/.env`.
